# =============================================================================
# llm-wiki / outer repository .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# This repo is the public framework (llm-wiki-public). The user's wiki content
# lives under vault/, which is intentionally NOT tracked here:
#   - vault/raw/        — user's pending PDFs
#   - vault/ingested/   — user's archived PDFs (immutable source of truth)
#   - vault/wiki/       — LLM-generated knowledge base (user-specific)
#
# New users bootstrap their vault/ by copying _skeleton/vault/ on first clone
# (see README.md). If they choose to track vault/ in a separate content repo,
# the nested .git inside vault/ also makes this directory effectively opaque
# to the outer repo — but we exclude it explicitly here regardless.
# =============================================================================

# Entire vault/ tree at repo root is user content.
# (Leading slash anchors to root, so _skeleton/vault/ is NOT excluded.)
/vault/

# docs/ contains user-local setup material (PDFs, screenshots, source markdown).
# The README now covers what new users need; docs/ is kept out of the public repo.
/docs/

# Local per-user Claude config (settings.json is the shared baseline)
.claude/settings.local.json

# OS / editor artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
*.tmp
.vscode/
.idea/
